---
import WikiLayout from '../layouts/WikiLayout.astro';
---

<WikiLayout title="Whats New?" description="All features, systems, and additions in Idle Guild Master Modded v1.3.20.10.">
  <div class="pageHeader">
    <div class="headerTop">
      <h1>Whats New?</h1>
      <span class="versionBadge">v1.3.20.10 Active</span>
    </div>
    <p>
      Idle Guild Master Modded (IGM+) is a massive expansion featuring a 4-branch Outlander class tree, 20 companion summons,
      a 26-axe weapon family, guild activities, new raids & fishing, universal combat formulas, and extensive quality-of-life additions.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Featured Highlights Grid -->
  <section class="highlightsSection">
    <h2>Major Mod Additions (v1.3.20.10)</h2>
    <div class="highlightsGrid">
      <!-- 1. Outlander Tree -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">New Class Tree</span>
          <h3>Outlander (T1–T9) & 4 Branches</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Complete 4-branch warrior tree from starter recruit to Tier 9 pinnacle masteries:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Outlander (T1):</strong> Uses Axes and Light Armor with multi-strike <strong>Wild Strikes</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Avatar of Wrath (T2–T9):</strong> Marauder &rarr; Barbarian &rarr; Berserker line with multi-strike flurries, on-kill recasts, and Savage Rage frenzy.</li>
          <li><strong>Beast Tamer (T2–T9):</strong> Heathen &rarr; Tamer line; casting Wild Strikes II heals active companions for 50%–150% of damage dealt.</li>
          <li><strong>Datura Hierophant (T3–T9):</strong> Druid &rarr; Archdruid line with nature magic inflicting Entangle and Thorns.</li>
          <li><strong>El Salvador (T3–T9):</strong> Exile &rarr; Desperado &rarr; El Salvador line with Evasion (+25% dodge), counterattacks, and Rapid Exploitation execute.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Companion Summons -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">Summons & Minions</span>
          <h3>20 Unique Minion Companions</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Fully playable minion companions with tactical skills and natural gear:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Tamed Beasts:</strong> Rats, Cats, Weasels, Wolves, Bears, Tigers, and Owlbears.</li>
          <li><strong>Undead Minions:</strong> Skeletons, Zombies, Bone Abominations, Bone Horrors, Bone Hydras, and Bone Nightmares.</li>
          <li><strong>Natural Equipment:</strong> Innate beast weapons (Fangs, Jaws, Paws, Claws) and armors (Pelts, Fur, Hides) with zero minion decay.</li>
          <li><strong>Tactical Skills:</strong> Rabid Bite, Feline Pounce, Frenzied Flurry, Pack Howl, Predatory Ambush, Ursine Roar, and Apex Rampage.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Arcanist Burst Mage -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">New Evolution Path</span>
          <h3>Single-Target Burst Mage Line (T3–T9)</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Adept's 3rd promotion choice alongside Fire Wizard and Dark Sorcerer:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>7 Tiers:</strong> Arcanist (T3) &rarr; Spellweaver (T4) &rarr; Aether Mage (T5) &rarr; Aether Archmage (T6) &rarr; Disintegrator (T7) &rarr; Grand Magus (T8) &rarr; Singularity Magus (T9).</li>
          <li><strong>Disintegrate Burst:</strong> Spells scaling up to 3000% damage with 20%–30% instant recast chance.</li>
          <li><strong>Aether Resonance:</strong> Bypasses enemy taunts to lock directly onto Bosses, with up to +70% defense penetration and Skill Amp.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. 26-Axe Weapon Family -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">Equipment</span>
          <h3>26-Axe Weapon Family & Gear</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">New melee weapon category scaling 100% Constitution + 100% Intelligence:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>26 Craftable Axes:</strong> Full progression from starter Stick up to Abhorrent Long Axe, Omni-Sever, and Wicked Cleaver.</li>
          <li><strong>Status Procs & Variance:</strong> Inherent &plusmn;20% to &plusmn;50% damage spread with Bleed, Freeze, Ablaze, and Stun.</li>
          <li><strong>Scarlet Armor Sets:</strong> Endgame armor rebalances focused on Skill Amp and Damage Dealt.</li>
          <li><strong>Unique Recovery:</strong> Buy back lost or evolved unique items from the Traveling Merchant.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Guild Activities -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">New Game Modes</span>
          <h3>Guild Activities & Reputation (5th Tab)</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Dedicated navigation tab for daily and weekly guild challenges:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Daily Request (The Hunt):</strong> Daily elite boss battle for up to 12 guild champions, with Gem rewards scaled to Reputation.</li>
          <li><strong>Weekly Siege:</strong> 10-wave horde survival challenge for your entire roster.</li>
          <li><strong>Reputation System:</strong> Dynamic 0–100 standing granting bonus daily gems on victory.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Raids & Expeditions -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">Expeditions & Raids</span>
          <h3>Raids, Minibosses & Fishing</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Challenging endgame expeditions and encounter mechanics:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The Sanguine Crucible:</strong> Archmagus Valthex raid with Bloodstone Colossus and Scarlet item drops.</li>
          <li><strong>The Slumbering Shallows:</strong> Fishing expedition with 6 catchable fish and the rare Chorus the Drowned specter (0.1%).</li>
          <li><strong>New Minibosses:</strong> Imperial Captain in The Golden City and Knight Slime in Slime Pond.</li>
          <li><strong>Clean Auto-Raid:</strong> Wiping resets the party and boss state cleanly with zero stuck encounters.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Combat Engine -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">Combat Engine</span>
          <h3>New Combat Stats & Formulas</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Universal combat math and impactful battle stats:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Menace:</strong> Damaging hits shred enemy physical and magic defense.</li>
          <li><strong>Guard:</strong> Ally heals, shields, and buffs grant bonus physical and magic defense.</li>
          <li><strong>Special Damage:</strong> Scales cleave true damage dealt to adjacent secondary targets.</li>
          <li><strong>New Status Effects:</strong> Rage (+30% dmg dealt/taken), Evasion (+25% dodge), Entangle (0% dodge, -20% dmg), and Thorns (damage recoil).</li>
          <li><strong>Universal Defense Curve:</strong> <code>floor((100 * DEF) / (50 + DEF))%</code> diminishing returns (50 DEF = 50% mitigation).</li>
          <li><strong>Percentage Attack Speed:</strong> Unified <code>+100% Attack Speed = +1 extra strike/round</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Pets & Evolution Vials -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">Pets & Traits</span>
          <h3>Mythic Pets & Evolution Vials</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Expanded companion systems and permanent trait customization:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Mythic Pets:</strong> Phoenix (passive Solar Rebirth revive) and Kitsune (Spirit Blessing aura) with 4-slot dynamic trait rolling.</li>
          <li><strong>Evo-21 & Evo-22:</strong> Swap common traits (Evo-21) and upgrade 7 common traits into Plus (+) variants (Evo-22).</li>
          <li><strong>Evo-23 & Evo-24:</strong> Swap rare traits (Evo-23) and upgrade 7 rare traits into Phylactery Plus (+) variants (Evo-24).</li>
          <li><strong>Doctrine Capstones:</strong> 7th ability nodes across all 8 doctrines.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- 9. Quality of Life -->
      <div class="highlightCard">
        <div class="cardHeader">
          <span class="cardCategory">Quality of Life</span>
          <h3>XP Books & Convenience</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="cardSummary">Streamlined player experience and roster management:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>XP Books (1, 2, 3, 10, Ancient):</strong> Batch consume books with stepper (-, +, MAX) and slider, instant level preview, and auto-cap protection.</li>
          <li><strong>Dungeon Gear Loadouts:</strong> Saves and auto-reequips gear per dungeon team.</li>
          <li><strong>Battle Status Inspector:</strong> Live dialog to inspect active buffs, debuffs, and stack counts during combat.</li>
          <li><strong>In-Game Changelog:</strong> View all mod update notes directly from the Settings menu.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</WikiLayout>

<style>
.pageHeader {
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.headerTop {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.headerTop h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 2.2rem;
}

.versionBadge {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  background: rgba(110, 168, 254, 0.15);
  color: var(--brand-primary);
  border: 1px solid rgba(110, 168, 254, 0.35);
  padding: 3px 9px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.pageHeader p {
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  max-width: 820px;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Highlights Grid */
.highlightsSection {
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

.highlightsSection h2 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.highlightsGrid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
}

.highlightCard {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
}

.highlightCard:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: var(--brand-primary);
}

.cardHeader {
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}

.cardCategory {
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--brand-primary);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}

.highlightCard h3 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.cardSummary {
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.4;
  margin: 0 0 0.65rem 0;
}

.highlightCard ul {
  padding-left: 1.15rem;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 0.84rem;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.highlightCard li {
  margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
}

.highlightCard li:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.highlightCard code {
  background: var(--bg-inset);
  padding: 1px 5px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: #93c5fd;
}
</style>
